<item>
<title>河上花歌</title>
<link>https://zhudasnotebook.com/%E6%96%87/%E6%B2%B3%E4%B8%8A%E8%8A%B1%E6%AD%8C/index.html?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=feed</link>
<guid>https://zhudasnotebook.com/%E6%96%87/%E6%B2%B3%E4%B8%8A%E8%8A%B1%E6%AD%8C/index.html?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=feed</guid>
<pubDate>01 Jan 1697 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
<description><![CDATA[<p>河上花歌。</p><p>蕙巖先生囑畫此卷，自丁丑五月以至六七八月，荷葉荷花落成，戲作河上花歌。</p><p><picture><source srcset="../河上花圖-detail.webp" type="image/webp"><img src="../河上花圖-detail.jpg" data-placeholder-src="../河上花圖-detail.jpg" width="3891" height="1840" loading="lazy" style="background-image:url(data:image/jpeg;base64,);background-size:cover" alt="河上花圖" /></picture></p><p>河上花，河上花。<br />
河上老人今白髮，前度河花紅似霞。</p><p>記得五十年前事，<br />
河上遊來今始知。<br />
花開花落兩由之，<br />
一日看盡長安花。</p><p>少時不識月，呼作白玉盤。<br />
今朝花開好，明日花落殘。</p><p>東西南北怪底同，<br />
朝還並蒂難重陳，<br />
至今想見芝山人。</p>]]></description>
</item>
<item>
<title>古梅圖題詩</title>
<link>https://zhudasnotebook.com/%E6%96%87/%E5%8F%A4%E6%A2%85%E9%A1%8C%E8%A9%A9/index.html?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=feed</link>
<guid>https://zhudasnotebook.com/%E6%96%87/%E5%8F%A4%E6%A2%85%E9%A1%8C%E8%A9%A9/index.html?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=feed</guid>
<pubDate>01 Jan 1696 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
<description><![CDATA[<p>分付梅花吳道人，幽幽翟翟莫相親。<br />
南山之南北山北，老得焚魚掃虜塵。</p>]]></description>
</item>
<item>
<title>孔雀竹石圖題詩</title>
<link>https://zhudasnotebook.com/%E6%96%87/%E5%AD%94%E9%9B%80%E9%A1%8C%E8%A9%A9/index.html?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=feed</link>
<guid>https://zhudasnotebook.com/%E6%96%87/%E5%AD%94%E9%9B%80%E9%A1%8C%E8%A9%A9/index.html?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=feed</guid>
<pubDate>01 Jan 1695 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
<description><![CDATA[<p>孔雀名花雨竹屏，竹梢強半墨生成。<br />
如何了得論三耳，恰是逢春坐二更。</p>]]></description>
</item>
<item>
<title>安晚帖魚題詩</title>
<link>https://zhudasnotebook.com/%E6%96%87/%E5%AE%89%E6%99%9A%E5%B8%96%E9%AD%9A%E9%A1%8C%E8%A9%A9/index.html?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=feed</link>
<guid>https://zhudasnotebook.com/%E6%96%87/%E5%AE%89%E6%99%9A%E5%B8%96%E9%AD%9A%E9%A1%8C%E8%A9%A9/index.html?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=feed</guid>
<pubDate>01 Jan 1694 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
<description><![CDATA[<p>左右此何水，名之曰曲河。<br />
更求淵注處，料得晚霞多。</p>]]></description>
</item>
<item>
<title>致方士琯書</title>
<link>https://zhudasnotebook.com/%E6%96%87/%E8%87%B4%E6%96%B9%E5%A3%AB%E7%90%AF%E6%9B%B8/index.html?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=feed</link>
<guid>https://zhudasnotebook.com/%E6%96%87/%E8%87%B4%E6%96%B9%E5%A3%AB%E7%90%AF%E6%9B%B8/index.html?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=feed</guid>
<pubDate>01 Jan 1690 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
<description><![CDATA[<p><picture><source srcset="../致方士琯書.webp" type="image/webp"><img src="../致方士琯書.jpg" data-placeholder-src="../致方士琯書.jpg" width="2605" height="3618" loading="lazy" style="background-image:url(data:image/jpeg;base64,);background-size:cover" alt="致方士琯書" /></picture></p><p>承惠書並筆墨，感感。近日苦於腳疾，不能遠行，尚冀秋涼再晤。</p><hr />
<p>前日承索畫數幀，已屬草草。近來目力漸衰，非昔比也。畫債甚多，容當緩緩奉上。</p><hr />
<p>弟居城南，菲薄度日。所幸筆墨尚在，聊以自遣。方兄遠寄紙筆，銘感不已。</p>]]></description>
</item>
<item>
<title>邵長蘅來訪</title>
<link>https://zhudasnotebook.com/%E6%96%87/%E9%82%B5%E9%95%B7%E8%98%85%E4%BE%86%E8%A8%AA/index.html?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=feed</link>
<guid>https://zhudasnotebook.com/%E6%96%87/%E9%82%B5%E9%95%B7%E8%98%85%E4%BE%86%E8%A8%AA/index.html?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=feed</guid>
<pubDate>01 Jan 1690 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
<description><![CDATA[<p>庚午秋，邵子湘自南京來。託僧澹雪約余，於北蘭寺相見。</p><p>是日大雨。余先至。</p><p>相見之際，互相凝視，握手大笑，如故人重逢。</p><p>余仍不語。癢不自禁，輒作手語。手語不盡，則取筆墨，疾書相酬。</p><p>對燭夜談，燭盡方別。</p><p>邵子湘後為余作傳。</p>]]></description>
</item>
<item>
<title>八大山人</title>
<link>https://zhudasnotebook.com/%E6%96%87/%E5%85%AB%E5%A4%A7%E5%B1%B1%E4%BA%BA/index.html?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=feed</link>
<guid>https://zhudasnotebook.com/%E6%96%87/%E5%85%AB%E5%A4%A7%E5%B1%B1%E4%BA%BA/index.html?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=feed</guid>
<pubDate>01 Jan 1684 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
<description><![CDATA[<p>甲子年秋七月朔，書黃庭內景經。始署「八大山人」。</p><p>八大者，四方四隅，皆我為大，而無大於我也。</p><p>又或曰：取八大人覺經之義。</p><p>「八大山人」四字聯綴：似哭之，似笑之。</p><p>哭笑不得之意。</p>]]></description>
</item>
<item>
<title>啞</title>
<link>https://zhudasnotebook.com/%E6%96%87/%E5%95%9E/index.html?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=feed</link>
<guid>https://zhudasnotebook.com/%E6%96%87/%E5%95%9E/index.html?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=feed</guid>
<pubDate>01 Jan 1680 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
<description><![CDATA[<p>還城。書一大「啞」字署門，不與人語。</p><p>然善笑。喜飲益甚。</p><p>賭酒勝則笑啞啞，數負則拳勝者背，笑愈啞啞不可止。</p><p>醉則往往唏噓泣下。</p>]]></description>
</item>
<item>
<title>發狂</title>
<link>https://zhudasnotebook.com/%E6%96%87/%E7%99%BC%E7%8B%82/index.html?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=feed</link>
<guid>https://zhudasnotebook.com/%E6%96%87/%E7%99%BC%E7%8B%82/index.html?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=feed</guid>
<pubDate>01 Jan 1679 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
<description><![CDATA[<p>臨川令胡亦堂招余修縣志。居官署逾年。</p><p>忽忽不自得，遂發狂疾。忽大笑，忽痛哭竟日。</p><p>一夕，裂其浮屠服，焚之，走還會城。</p><p>獨自徜徉市肆間。常戴布帽，曳長領袍，履穿踵決，拂袖翩躚行。市中兒隨觀嘩笑，人莫識也。</p>]]></description>
</item>
<item>
<title>個山小像自題</title>
<link>https://zhudasnotebook.com/%E6%96%87/%E5%80%8B%E5%B1%B1%E5%B0%8F%E5%83%8F/index.html?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=feed</link>
<guid>https://zhudasnotebook.com/%E6%96%87/%E5%80%8B%E5%B1%B1%E5%B0%8F%E5%83%8F/index.html?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=feed</guid>
<pubDate>01 Jan 1674 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
<description><![CDATA[<p>個山小像。時年四十有九。</p><hr />
<p>生在曹洞臨濟有，穿過臨濟曹洞有。<br />
洞曹臨濟兩俱非，嬴嬴然若喪家之狗。<br />
還識得此人麼？</p><hr />
<p>沒毛驢，初生兔。<br />
剺破面門，手足無措。<br />
莫是悲他世上人，到頭不識來時路。<br />
今朝且喜當行，穿過葛藤露布。<br />
咄！</p>]]></description>
</item>
<item>
<title>落髮</title>
<link>https://zhudasnotebook.com/%E6%96%87/%E8%90%BD%E9%AB%AE/index.html?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=feed</link>
<guid>https://zhudasnotebook.com/%E6%96%87/%E8%90%BD%E9%AB%AE/index.html?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=feed</guid>
<pubDate>01 Jan 1648 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
<description><![CDATA[<p>奉母朱氏攜弟至奉新山中，薙髮為僧。法名傳綮，字刃庵。</p><p>住山二十年，從學者常百餘人。</p><p>不敢言姓。不敢言名。不敢言故國。</p><p>問則不答。答則以手指天。</p>]]></description>
</item>
<item>
<title>國破</title>
<link>https://zhudasnotebook.com/%E6%96%87/%E5%9C%8B%E7%A0%B4/index.html?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=feed</link>
<guid>https://zhudasnotebook.com/%E6%96%87/%E5%9C%8B%E7%A0%B4/index.html?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=feed</guid>
<pubDate>01 Jan 1644 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
<description><![CDATA[<p>甲申三月十九日，思宗皇帝崩於煤山。</p><p>是年，清兵入關，鐵騎南下。乙酉年，南昌陷。宗室遭屠，父死，妻亡。</p><p>余年十八。</p><p>天地之間，忽然只剩下一個人。</p>]]></description>
</item>
